  "description": "The Annex Pro model takes things to the next level in multiple ways. Starting off with a 20.5\" top tube 6061 alloy frame which has larger geometry and tubing than that found on the Expert model. 8\" rise bars and 100% chromoly fork with 1 1/8\" steer tube provide adequate size and strength for proper front end control. The Annex Pro also comes with 175mm 3 piece chromoly cranks and full sized 20\" 36 spoke alloy wheels which increase strength and are versatile for riding/racing at the BMX track and all around riding.\n6061 series alloy frame\n100% chromoly fork\nHi-ten bars and Haro alloy front load stem\n3-piece chromoly race cranks\nKenda Kontact tires\nPadded one piece with built in alloy post\nPromax V-Brake and lever",
